%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b0bf90f96773687418d2d0ad8d599d18, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeSlotCatalog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Kismeta.UI::Kismeta.UI.Narrative.NarrativeSlotCatalog
  _entries:
  - _id: spring.intro
    _season: 0
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: A new age dawns over Kismeta. The stars take their stations, and the alchemists
      gather their fortune.
    _charge: 'Open the round: set the cosmic age, find your sign, and gather your
      harvest.'
    _stakes: "This age's sign shapes everything \u2014 which cards harvest well,
      which alignments score, and your own cosmic effect for the round."
    _verbs:
    - Begin Spring
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.setage
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 1
    _beat: The Agekeeper rolls, and the heavens choose the age for all.
    _charge: "Read the age's three Aspects \u2014 Sign, Planet, Element \u2014 and
      its cosmic effect aloud."
    _stakes: Every harvest bonus and alignment this round is measured against these
      three Aspects.
    _verbs:
    - Cast the age
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.sign
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 2
    _beat: Your own die falls, and the cosmos names you for the age.
    _charge: "Roll your Zodiac die and move your meeple to your sign \u2014 your
      identity for this round."
    _stakes: Your sign is an alignment source AND grants a personal cosmic effect
      that lasts until Winter.
    _verbs:
    - Roll your zodiac die
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.harvest
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 3
    _beat: The age is generous to those who align with it.
    _charge: Tally your bonus from every source, then take your full harvest from
      the Agekeeper.
    _stakes: "Each source scores only its single highest Aspect \u2014 Sign +3, Planet
      +2, Element +1. Nothing stacks within a source."
    _verbs:
    - Deal & commune
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.commune
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: "Lay your fortune out \u2014 what you show, and what you keep."
    _charge: Sort your cards into Spread (visible engine) and Hand (hidden reserve).
      Major Arcana go to your Arcanum.
    _stakes: Spread cards score alignment and activate Crucibles but can be stolen
      in a Duel. Hand cards are safe but idle.
    _verbs:
    - "Lock the tableau \xB7 to Summer"
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: spring.lock
    _season: 0
    _tier: 1
    _order: 5
    _beat: The stars fix what you have wrought.
    _charge: "Confirm your placement \u2014 cards freeze between Spread and Hand
      until Winter."
    _stakes: Over-load your Spread and you expose value to theft; under-load it and
      you starve your engine. This is binding.
    _verbs:
    - "Lock \U0001F512"
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.intro
    _season: 1
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: The sun rides high and the work is long. Forge your reagents, raise your
      houses, and reckon with your rivals.
    _charge: "Take any actions, in any order, as many as you can fuel \u2014 no fixed
      order, no turn limit."
    _stakes: This is where the round is won or lost. Repeat actions as long as you
      have cards and reagents to spend.
    _verbs:
    - Begin Summer
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.hub
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 1
    _beat: The sun rides high and the work is long.
    _charge: "Take any actions, in any order, as many as you can fuel \u2014 no fixed
      order, no turn limit."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Craft
    - Consort
    - Activate
    - Pass
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.activate
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 2
    _beat: The formula handed down by the Fates comes due.
    _charge: Collect a Codex card set in your Spread, discard it, light the matching
      cauldron, and flip the Crucible card face-up.
    _stakes: "The coal can never be moved once placed \u2014 light the cauldron your
      higher-tier cards will demand."
    _verbs:
    - Activate
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.craft
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 3
    _beat: Raw cards become the fuel of transmutation.
    _charge: "Discard 3 suit-matching cards into a lit cauldron to craft 1 elemental
      reagent. Salt needs no cauldron \u2014 any 3 cards."
    _stakes: Reagents only transfer by Trade. Each elemental type needs its own cauldron
      lit first.
    _verbs:
    - Forge
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.buildhouse
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: A permanent anchor rises in an ever-turning sky.
    _charge: "Pay 2 cards matching your sign's planet to raise a House \u2014 a permanent
      harvest source, opposition boost, and cosmic effect."
    _stakes: "Houses are permanent \u2014 the cards are spent for good and cannot
      be reclaimed. Build deliberately."
    _verbs:
    - Raise the House
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.wards
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 5
    _beat: Set your tolls before the rivals come.
    _charge: Place reagents on your Active Crucible or Adept cards to set the fee
      challengers must pay to Gambit them.
    _stakes: Crucible wards are permanent; Adept wards return if the Adept leaves
      play. An unwarded active card can be gambited for free.
    _verbs:
    - Seal the wards
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.trade
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 6
    _beat: Bargains struck beneath the high sun.
    _charge: "Exchange cards, reagents, or Active Crucible cards freely with a rival
      \u2014 the only way to move reagents."
    _stakes: Hidden Hand cards cannot be requested. In Magnus mode, misaligned players
      trade 2:1.
    _verbs:
    - Complete trade
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.duel
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 7
    _beat: Steel meets steel over a coveted card.
    _charge: "Name a card in a rival's Spread, ante a card of your own, and roll
      \u2014 higher roll takes the prize."
    _stakes: Lose, and your ante returns to the deck. Only Spread cards can be targeted;
      the Hand is safe.
    _verbs:
    - Ante & roll
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: summer.gambit
    _season: 1
    _tier: 1
    _order: 8
    _beat: A wager against the Fates themselves.
    _charge: Stake one of your Active cards to seize a rival's Crucible or Adept
      card. Pay their ward fee, then roll.
    _stakes: "Lose, and your offered card is Arrested \u2014 pay 1 Salt to free it,
      and you can't re-gambit that rival this round."
    _verbs:
    - Challenge this rival
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: autumn.intro
    _season: 2
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: "The crucible runs hot. Drive your stone toward gold \u2014 but a forging
      stone is a stone exposed."
    _charge: "Advance your stone through the forge \u2014 and oppose any rival that
      dares to forge."
    _stakes: The moment your stone enters the forge it can be Opposed. Weigh advancing
      now against waiting for a safer age.
    _verbs:
    - Begin Autumn
    _breadcrumb: Forging
  - _id: autumn.survey
    _season: 2
    _tier: 1
    _order: 1
    _beat: Read the forge before you move.
    _charge: "Note every stone's position \u2014 Mantle (safe), Forge (vulnerable),
      Stasis (frozen), or the Altar."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Survey
    _breadcrumb: Survey
  - _id: autumn.oppose
    _season: 2
    _tier: 1
    _order: 2
    _beat: Align against a rival and break their forging.
    _charge: Pay the defender's ward fee, roll, and total your Aspect alignment.
      Win, and their stone falls to Stasis.
    _stakes: "Each defense the rival survives grants them a stacking Besieged Bonus
      \u2014 a dogpile on the leader can backfire."
    _verbs:
    - Oppose
    _breadcrumb: Opposing
  - _id: autumn.fire
    _season: 2
    _tier: 1
    _order: 3
    _beat: Commit your stone to the flames.
    _charge: "Satisfy an Active Crucible card's formula \u2014 alignment + reagents
      \u2014 and advance your stone into the forge."
    _stakes: A stone Fired this Autumn is safe this round, but Forging next round
      leaves it open to Opposition. Ward as you advance.
    _verbs:
    - Fire
    _breadcrumb: Forging
  - _id: autumn.temper
    _season: 2
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: A full round in the fire, and the stage is sealed forever.
    _charge: Advance a stone that has forged a full round to the next Mantle space
      and discard its Crucible card.
    _stakes: "A stone that returned from Stasis this round cannot Temper yet \u2014
      it must forge a full round first."
    _verbs:
    - Temper
    _breadcrumb: Tempering
  - _id: autumn.leavestasis
    _season: 2
    _tier: 1
    _order: 5
    _beat: Rekindle a stalled stone.
    _charge: Pay 2 Salt to return your stone to its old forge position and resume
      forging.
    _stakes: If your old position is taken, you must wait a round or win a Stasis
      Opposition to swap into it.
    _verbs:
    - Leave Stasis
    _breadcrumb: In Stasis
  - _id: winter.intro
    _season: 3
    _tier: 0
    _order: 0
    _beat: The forge fires bank low. What was gained is reckoned, what was held is
      loosed, and the wheel turns toward a new age.
    _charge: 'Close the age: unlock your cards, place an optional wager, enforce
      limits, and transit to the next age.'
    _stakes: Only your cards reset. Lit cauldrons, astral houses, active Crucible
      cards, and your stone's forge position all carry forward.
    _verbs:
    - Begin Winter
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: winter.unlock
    _season: 3
    _tier: 1
    _order: 1
    _beat: The stars release their hold.
    _charge: Move cards freely between Hand and Spread one last time before the age
      closes.
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Unlock cards
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: winter.wager
    _season: 3
    _tier: 1
    _order: 2
    _beat: Bet on the sign the coming age will wear.
    _charge: Predict the next cosmic sign and stake any cards from your Spread or
      Hand. Guess right and your wager doubles.
    _stakes: Guess wrong and the cards are lost to the Fates. Major Arcana in your
      Arcanum cannot be wagered.
    _verbs:
    - Place wager
    - Skip wager
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: winter.limits
    _season: 3
    _tier: 1
    _order: 3
    _beat: Pare back to what you can carry into the dark.
    _charge: Discard down to 5 Spread and 5 Hand. Return all Fate cards to the deck;
      Adepts remain.
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Enforce limits
    _breadcrumb: 
  - _id: winter.transit
    _season: 3
    _tier: 1
    _order: 4
    _beat: The key passes, and the wheel turns toward a sign unknown until the dice
      fall.
    _charge: "The Agekeeper shuffles the deck and passes the key clockwise \u2014
      a new age begins, unless the Great Work is done."
    _stakes: 
    _verbs:
    - Turn the wheel
    - cast the next age
    _breadcrumb: 
